{"synopsis":"Permainan telah berubah menjadi kenyataan, era pergantian kelas telah tiba!\n\nSu Yang mengubah kelasnya dan menjadi pejuang sederhana.\n\nTapi tanpa diduga, dia menemukan bahwa dia telah berubah menjadi Bos Naga Hitam Level 99 juga?\n\nPertama kali dia mencoba terhubung dengan BOSS, dia bertemu dengan guild level A yang berdiri di depannya?\n\nMenghadapi para pengubah kelas yang bersenjata lengkap, Su Yang dengan santai memuntahkan seteguk api hitam-\n\n[Kamu telah memusnahkan guild “Spirit Hunt”]\n\n[Exp diperoleh +990.000, level 1-20 (exp meluap, harap ubah kelas sesegera mungkin]\n\n[Mendapatkan jarahan: Diamond Rank: Great Sword – Storm’s Call, gulir perubahan kelas…]\n\nPerlahan, BOSS Naga Hitam berubah menjadi Abyss Lord level 999.\n\nSu Yang menyadari bahwa dia tampaknya tak terkalahkan?","alternative_title":"开局兼任黑龙boss，我无敌了, Kaiju Jianren Heilong boss, Wo Wudile","author":"扑土","artist":"Huxiu Studio (虎岫工作室)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"d80c53e2-ee13-4347-bc53-8c1e73e4ba07","number":"100","chapter":"100","title":"","date":"2026-05-07","released":"2026-05-07"},{"chapter_id":"a7c897af-50e3-40b2-a9cc-1513a0261b20","number":"99","chapter":"99","title":"","date":"2026-05-06","released":"2026-05-06"},{"chapter_id":"b21e1b7e-6370-4ab9-9e78-81d54206a3e5","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"","date":"2026-04-19","released":"2026-04-19"},{"chapter_id":"ecfdebad-7d71-406b-a189-5238bbfeaf72","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"","date":"2026-04-05","released":"2026-04-05"},{"chapter_id":"83079b2e-957d-4445-8e54-59eb00870a96","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"","date":"2026-03-25","released":"2026-03-25"},{"chapter_id":"aa4dabac-3d9c-45b6-8efc-917188d3336e","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"","date":"2026-03-12","released":"2026-03-12"},{"chapter_id":"3f32ac42-e1f5-424d-9fdf-ca4686713b34","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"","date":"2026-02-27","released":"2026-02-27"},{"chapter_id":"90661682-1722-4a59-a301-27d2f9ac38af","number":"93","chapter"